title: 'net/litep2p: Use manual routing table update and support `--no-private-ip`'
doc:
- audience: [Node Dev, Node Operator]
  description: |-
    Switch to manual routing table update in litep2p network backend, populating peer addresses
    from Identify events instead of blindly trusting Kademlia responses.

    Additionally, add support for `--no-private-ip` flag with litep2p network backend.
crates:
- name: sc-network
  bump: major
- name: sc-network-types
  bump: major
- name: sc-network-bitswap
  bump: patch
